<div class="wp-block-group hk-panel hk-panel--prose"><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-intro"} -->
<p class="hk-intro">This Privacy Policy explains how the Hakari food-safety school collects, processes, and protects your personal data when you use our website and learning platform.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {"className":"hk-read","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group hk-read"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Data Collection for Course Delivery and Fulfillment</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">The Hakari food-safety school, founded in 2016 and located at Havenkade 14, 3024 Rotterdam, Netherlands, acts as the data controller for your personal information. When you enrol in a cohort or sign up for waitlist updates, we collect necessary personal details including your name, email address, phone number, billing address, and physical shipping address for equipment delivery. We use this data exclusively to fulfil your practical kit orders, provide access to the online learning system, communicate cohort announcements, and process payments. We never sell or lease learner information to third-party commercial marketing organizations.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Exam Proctoring and Assessment Privacy</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">To maintain assessment integrity for our supervisor certification, the final 40-question online exam utilizes webcam and screen proctoring. During the 60-minute examination session, video and audio data are captured strictly for identity verification and anti-cheating monitoring. These assessment recordings are stored securely in encrypted cloud storage with restricted administrative access. Proctoring data is reviewed solely by designated exam evaluators and is automatically deleted within ninety days of examination completion. Learners are informed prior to launching the exam environment and must grant explicit camera permissions before the test begins.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"className":"hk-rh"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading hk-rh">Data Retention, Learner Rights, and Contact Information</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"hk-body"} -->
<p class="hk-body">We retain transactional records and certificate verification data for three years in alignment with supervisor certificate validity periods. You hold the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections to erroneous records, or ask for the deletion of personal details where legal retention obligations permit. If you have any questions regarding your data privacy or wish to exercise your rights, please contact Tomás Brandt at hello@hakari-course.example or by post to Havenkade 14, 3024 Rotterdam. Inquiries receive a formal response within one working day.</p>
